      "height": 219,
      "content": "General 包含\n* Button ☑️\n* Sound play\n* Icons  ☑️\n* Link\n* Typography ☑️\n  * H1-H6\n* Navigation\n  * Navigation bar  ☑️\n  * Menu list\n  * Dropdown\n  * Pagination  ☑️\n* Data display\n  * Card\n  * Empty\n  * Tooltip\n  * Tabs\n  * Popover\n  * Loading status\n* Data Input\n  * Input ☑️\n  * Checkbox\n  * Form\n    * Tag ☑️\n    * Select\n    * Radio group ☑️\n    * Switch ☑️\n* Feedback\n  * Modal ☑️\n  * Loading status"
