      "content": "命名维度：type/size/variant/shape/state\ntype= Button、input？？\n\nsize=  Small （26） Medium （32） Large （40）\nvariant= Primary Secondary Default White Danger Success Blue Purple\nshape= Default Circle Square \nstate= Default Hover Click Loading Disabled Focus\n\n对应到按钮 type=Button\nButton/Medium/Primary/Square/Default\nButton/Medium/Primary/Square/Hover\nButton/Medium/Primary/Square/Click\n\nButton/Small/Primary/Square/Default\nButton/Large/Primary/Square/Default"
